      "canonical_name": "Engineered latent TGFB1 proprotein construct (5FFO)",
      "category": "tool",
      "pdb": "5ffo",
      "reference": "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5586147/",
      "reason": "Primary methods report C4S,R249A,N107Q,N147Q in mature/proprotein numbering, including disabled furin cleavage and glycosylation sites. SEQADV independently records N136Q/N176Q in P01137 precursor numbering. Deposited sequence/methods discrepancies remain; do not imply native or mature active TGFB1.",
