      "https://files.rcsb.org/header/5FFO.pdb"
    ],
    "numbering_caveat": "Primary methods report C4S, R249A furin-site and N107Q/N147Q changes; deposited SEQADV records precursor-numbered N136Q/N176Q. This proposal does not invent a complete positional reconciliation or claim all experimental substitutions are represented in modeled coordinates."
